A) Mac check 379e137 item 9: after a mainline journey (04->05 meadow, 08->09 skycity) the
   board exits to the region and there was no way back: returnHome needs the island, the
   journey has no walk-back route (exitSkycity/ensureRegion refuse) and the 回主页 control
   was never shown. Now:
   - RegionJourneyController.returnToIsland(): release journey scenes, region=island, idle.
   - WorldFlow.returnHome(): from an arrived meadow/skycity journey region (or a paused/
     failed journey) set her back on the island, then walk home as usual. Not a completion:
     unlocks/records stay in the campaign save; the next trip walks the route again.
     Level (board exit first), active travel (busy) and the skycity VISIT are unchanged.
   - WorldIntegrationBoot: 「主页」 control shown in meadow and journey-skycity.
   - test-world-region-home.cjs: returnHome after arriving in meadow and skycity, etc.
B) Arrival 12 m back / 1.5 m right / 2 m up, view pitched 2.5 deg up (arrivalPitchDeg),
   2.5 m late lift: her centre 75% of the width (was 86-89%), plaza 50%/55%, h 0.153,
   feet 21.9% above the bottom, rock 5/25, turn 18.9 deg/s. F9 asserts x <= 80%.
